# SmartBeads (always-on)

When work touches `PROJECTS/SmartBeads/`:

- **STOP gate first** → `.cursor/rules/instruction-fidelity.mdc` § STOP — quote ask, list files, wait for go
- **Rules** → `VISION/CURSOR_PROMPT_01.md` § SmartBeads Production Gates + `GPT_PROJECT_RULES_01P.md`
- **Literal ask** — option ≠ default ≠ best label ≠ doc update; one-line ask = one-line change unless user lists more
- **Gaps (code ≠ claim)** → `GPT_PROJECT_STATUS_01P.md` § Integrity
- **Done** → test or verify; never claim complete without evidence
- **Big change** → list and get approval first
- **One playtest bug** → failing test + suite sweep + related fixes
- **Prototype ≠ production** — no shared code with `src/`
- **Protected docs** — do not edit `VISION_05P.md` or `GPT_PROJECT_RULES_01P.md` to fit code
- **No stale residue** — after a fix pass: remove dead/wrong code, false claims, and inline asset embeds that belong in `public/`; sync `GPT_PROJECT_STATUS_01P.md` + `PROJECT_MAP_05P.md` + `GPT_PROJECT_AUDIT_05P.md` when counts or behaviour change; **never** edit `VISION/CLAUDE_TEST_REPORT_05.md` (not agent scope)
- **Static assets** — SFX/images load from `public/` at runtime; do not re-inline large base64 blobs into TS bundles
